<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Choice Holdings issues profit warning.</title>
<headline>Choice Holdings issues profit warning.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-05-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Choice Holdings Ltd on Friday warned shareholders that the total loss atributable to shareholders for the year ended February 28, 1997 will be greater than anticipated.</p>
<p>The company said in a profit warning that shareholders should exercise caution in their sharedealings until the publication of year results on or about May 30, 1997.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom, +27-11 482-1003</p>
</text>
